@startuml
title Phase 11 — console-postreq — plan

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

start

:11.1 plan and scope (branch ph11-postreq -> dev; tracker milestone v1 - phases 11-12);

partition "Deferred modules (one commit each)" {
  :11.2 #43 wire sync (single-node scope);
  :11.3 #44 compose obsv substrate;
  :11.4 #45 compose visualizer;
  :11.5 #46 registry teams/routines/policies;
  :11.6 #47 runtime/lifecycle;
  :11.7 #48 A8 routing/budget residual;
}

:11.8 summary + close out issues;

stop

note right
  Compose into app/ (control plane) and ui/ (console).
  Gates: gofmt/build/vet/test,
  archtest, control-plane httptest,
  revu (bot-authored, static-only).
  Track phases 11 & 12 via the
  "v1 - phases 11-12" milestone.
end note

@enduml
